    "gpr task create (create a new task)",
    "gpr task list (list tasks and their states)",
    "gpr task assign (assign task to agent on machine)",
    "gpr workspace init (initialize a workspace)",
    "gpr machine list (list connected machines)",
    "gpr agent list (list configured agents)",
